      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu dakudi Yehova denjili kudi Yeremiya, helili mukulumpi wawa tulama Nebuzaradani namuumbuku dehi kuRama, helili anamutwali dehi wakukasa mumalepi, hamu nawantu ejima amuYerusalema naYuda adiŋi nakutwalawu kuBabiloni muwukoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukulumpi wawatulama haku mutambika Yeremiya, hakumwila nindi, Yehova Nzambi yeyi diyiwashimwini yumiyi yatama yakeŋa kumona mukala wunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nino duYehova nachikoŋi dehi, neli mwahosheliyi. Chimuna muvulumuni Yehova nichimunabuli kwovwahila izu dindi, dihu hanayiweni chumichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichidinu tiya, lelu nakusubuli dehi mumaleŋi adiŋi kumakaseyi. Neyi wunatiyikuwaha kuya nanami kuBabiloni, twatuyi, nukukutalaŋa chachiwahi. Ilaŋa neyi wunatiyi kutama kuya nanami kuBabiloni, dishakamini kweyi. Talaku, ituŋa dejima didi kumesu eyi, kwonsu kuwunamoni kuwaha kunayi muchima weyi kwoku kuwukuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadiŋa iyi kanda afunti, mukwawuha kumwila nindi, Komana funtaku kweyi kudi Gedaliya mwana kaAhikami, Ahikami mwana kaShafwani, anakunjikuwu kudi mwanta wakuBabiloni kwikala nguvulu wanyikala yawaYuda, wakashakami nindi hamu nawantu. Neyi nehi, yaku tuhu kweyi kwonsu kunayi muchima weyi. Dichi mukulumpi wa awatulama hakumwinka niyakudya nichamukunkulu, hakumuleka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu cheliluwu awakulumpi ayendu yadiŋi mumpata, niwena niantu awu, chatiyiluwu nawu, Mwanta wakuBabiloni nakunjiki dehi mwana kaAhikami Gedaliya kwikala nguvulu yetuŋa, namwinki dehi ni amayala, niambanda, nianyana, niatuzweŋi amwituŋakweti abulili kutwalawu kuBabiloni muwukoli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiyakwinza kudi Gedaliya kuMizipa, iwu mwana kaNetaniya Ishimeli, awa anyana kaKareya aYohanani najonatani, iwumwana kaTanihu meti Seraya, awa anyana kaEfwayi wakuNetofwati, iwumwana kamu kwaMayakati Yezaniya, niwena niantu awu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedaliya mwana kaAhikami, Ahikami mwana kaShafwani, hakuhoshanawena nawantu awu mazu akusanyika, nindi, Bayi mutiya woma wakuyikalakela aKaladeya ku. Shakamenu mwituŋa, mumukalakelapa mwantawa kuBabiloni, mwakashakami chachiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila ami nukushakama kuMizipa kulonda kuyikalakelaŋa aKaladeya akenzaŋa kudetu. Kwinza enu kwenu kuŋulenu kwenu nivinyu, ninyikabu yahachilaaka chankanza, nimanji mwakayishi muyuma yenu yakusendela, mwakashakamaŋa munyikalayenu yimunatambuli tambuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NiaYudeya ejima nawa adiŋa nimuMowabi, nimukachi kawanyana kaAmoni, nimuEdomi, niadiŋa mumatuŋa ejima, chatiyiluwu nawu, Mwantawa kuBabiloni nashiyuhu aYuda amakwawu, nayikunjikili dehi Gedaliya mwana kaAhikami, Ahikami mwana kaShafwani, kwikala nguvulu yawu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AYohanani mwana kaKareya nawawakulumpi ejima ayendu yadiŋamumasapa, hiyakwinza kudi Gedaliya kuMizipa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiyakumwila nawu, Eyi kwiluka neyi Bayalisi mwanta wawanyana kaAmoni natemesni dehi mwana kaNetaniya Ishimeli kulonda akujahuku? Ilaŋa mwana kaAhika miGedaliya hayi itiyili kwinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaKareya Yohanani hakuhosha naGedaliya kuMizipa kumbepu, nindi, Nleki mwani niyi nakamujahi mwana kaNetaniya Ishimeli, kwosi muntu wakachilukaku. Indi yena akujahi tuhukulonda aYudeya ejima anapompi kudeyi akamwaŋali tuhu kwawu, niantu amuYuda anashaluhu akanoŋi tuhu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaAhikami Gedaliya hakumwila mwana kaKareya Yohanani, nindi, Bayi wila chumichuku, wudina kumutwambila Ishimeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
